{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:16 2026-11-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:16 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:16 2026-11-02 HKT</p><img alt=\"葵涌小巴與兩私家車相撞 至少7傷送院。Threads：ellieleongyoga\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e8b627b5811c4e777878d1607bab849/2026-11/879283275_17969565087199110_9200315537409979905_n.jpg\"/><p>葵涌荃灣路近葵順街遊樂場，今日（11月2日）晚上近7時半，一部紅色小巴與兩部私家車意外相撞。意外中至少7人受傷，多為小巴乘客。警方消防接報趕至，其後安排傷者送往瑪嘉烈醫院救治。意外原因仍在調查。</p><p>事故期間，荃灣路往屯門公路方向近興芳路快線封閉，交通繁忙，其後陸續解封。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:41:16.121122+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:16:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T00:38:40.790045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:38.449700+00:00","content_hash":"fbdda2996f265e1cc46b34741784a54fb761b571b9f76d446cb6615660fd95d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}